#. module: bf_cx_onboarding
#: model:onboarding.onboarding.step,description:bf_cx_onboarding.bf_onb_step_complaint_team
msgid ""
"[action:base.action_res_users] Add your colleagues to the Customer "
"experience groups (user or manager) and set the complaint acknowledgement "
"delay in the settings."
msgstr ""
"[action:base.action_res_users] Ajoutez vos collègues aux groupes Expérience "
"client (utilisateur ou gestionnaire) et réglez le délai d'accusé de "
"réception des plaintes dans les paramètres."

#. module: bf_cx_onboarding
#: model:onboarding.onboarding.step,description:bf_cx_onboarding.bf_onb_step_program
msgid ""
"[action:bf_cx.action_cx_program] Create a measurement program (relationship "
"NPS, transactional CSAT or continuous pulse) linked to its Odoo survey."
msgstr ""
"[action:bf_cx.action_cx_program] Créez un programme de mesure (NPS "
"relationnel, CSAT transactionnel ou pulse continu) relié à son sondage Odoo."

#. module: bf_cx_onboarding
#: model:onboarding.onboarding.step,description:bf_cx_onboarding.bf_onb_step_cadence
msgid ""
"[action:bf_cx.action_cx_settings] Set the global over-solicitation guard "
"and, if needed, each program's own minimum cadence (common practice: 90 days"
" for a relationship NPS)."
msgstr ""
"[action:bf_cx.action_cx_settings] Réglez le garde-fou anti-sursollicitation "
"global et, au besoin, la cadence minimale propre à chaque programme "
"(pratique : 90 jours pour un NPS relationnel)."

#. module: bf_cx_onboarding
#: model:onboarding.onboarding.step,description:bf_cx_onboarding.bf_onb_step_wave
msgid ""
"[action:bf_cx.action_cx_wave] Build a wave of recipients, then send the "
"invitations: the answers feed the feedback register automatically."
msgstr ""
"[action:bf_cx.action_cx_wave] Composez une vague de destinataires puis "
"envoyez les invitations : les réponses alimentent automatiquement le "
"registre des feedbacks."
